{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "clm_atm_forcing",
  "description": "CTSM/CLM atmospheric-forcing import and downscaling (stage 2 of the EqESM project; ctsm5.4.063, cesm3.0-alphabranch): the land side of the datm -> CLM boundary, i.e. the atm2lnd input fields of the stage1/boundaries.md 1.5 boundary table. Two models. ImportFields is import_fields of cpl/nuopc/lnd_import_export.F90:542-577 plus derive_quantities of cpl/utils/lnd_import_export_utils.F90:61-91: the mediator Sa_*/Faxa_* fields into the gridcell-level forc_* state (forc_hgt/forc_topo/forc_u/forc_v/forc_q/forc_th/forc_pbot/forc_t, the observation heights forc_hgt_u/t/q, the vapor pressure forc_vp = q*pbot/(0.622 + 0.378*q), the density forc_rho = (pbot - 0.378*forc_vp)/(rair*forc_t), forc_po2, the wind speed forc_wind = sqrt(u^2 + v^2), the total solar forc_solar, the convective/large-scale rain and snow, the total forc_rain/forc_snow and the relative humidity forc_rh = 100*q/qsat); the vp/density laws are shared with the DATM datamode by reference (cdeps_templates.esm vapor_pressure/density, datm_datamode_clmncep_mod.F90:428-429 are the same formulas) and the saturation humidity is the CLM QSat law (clm_templates.esm qsat_qs, QSatMod.F90:90-103). Downscale is downscale_forcings of main/atm2lndMod.F90:98-284: the gridcell-to-column copies over all active columns (F90:180-195), the elevation topo downscaling over the DownscaleFilterc columns (the glacier landunit columns; F90:202-267: tbot_c = tbot_g - lapse_rate*(hsurf_c - hsurf_g), Hbot = rair*0.5*(tbot_g + tbot_c)/grav, pbot_c = pbot_g*exp(-(hsurf_c - hsurf_g)/Hbot), thbot_c = thbot_g + (tbot_c - tbot_g)*exp((zbot/Hbot)*(rair/cpair)), qbot_c = qbot_g*qs_c/qs_g with the QSat humidities, rhos_c = rhos_g*rhos_c_estimate/rhos_g_estimate via the clm_templates.esm:rhos law), the precipitation rain/snow repartition over all columns (F90:359-390 with the ramp frac_rain = clamp((forc_t_c - all_snow_t)*frac_rain_slope, 0, 1), F90:419-426, and the glc/nonglc ramp endpoints of ctsm60_params.c260518.nc: glc -2..0 C, nonglc 0..2 C) and the longwave downscaling branch (F90:506-568; inactive at glcmec_downscale_longwave = .false., the traced configuration; the per-column lapse + clamp of F90:532-541 is transcribed and the energy-conserving gridcell normalization of F90:544-568 is a documented scheme gap - it needs the gridcell column weights, and is not exercised by any dump). The namelist/parameter values are the I2000Clm60Sp run's (lnd_in: repartition_rain_snow = .true., glcmec_downscale_longwave = .false., lapse_rate = 0.006; the lapse_rate_longwave = 0.032, longwave_downscaling_limit = 0.5 and ramp endpoints are the ctsm60 params/namelist defaults). The tests pin the stage-1 CLM dumps (stage1/dumps/clm/clm_bareground.csv, clm_canopyflux.csv stage hyd, clm_surfrad.csv) against the datm export dump (stage1/dumps/cdeps/datm_gswp3_exports.csv) on the overlapping (cell, step) rows: columns c = 1..5 at steps s = 1..12 (the South Pole row; the five traced cells are value-identical, so cell 1 pins all of them) are driven by the datm exports one coupling interval earlier (step s - 1) - the land receives the atmosphere of the previous interval because the data atmosphere runs after the land in the CESM run sequence (verified: every forc_* dump value equals its Sa_*/Faxa_* export bit-exact). The traced columns are non-glacier soil columns (needs_downscaling = 0), so the tests exercise the copy + partition_precip path; the topo-downscaling, longwave and glc-ramp branches are transcribed but have no dump coverage. Reference: stage1/cesm/components/clm/src/cpl/nuopc/lnd_import_export.F90, cpl/utils/lnd_import_export_utils.F90, main/atm2lndMod.F90, main/atm2lndType.F90.",
  "license": "MIT"
 },
 "models": {
  "ImportFields": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {"ref": "./clm_templates.esm"},
    {"ref": "./cdeps_templates.esm"}
   ],
   "variables": {
    "Sa_z": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m", "default": 30.0, "description": "atmospheric reference height export (Sa_z; 30 m when the stream does not provide it), [m]"},
    "Sa_topo": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m", "default": 0.0, "description": "atmospheric surface elevation export (Sa_topo), [m]"},
    "Sa_u": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m/s", "default": 0.0, "description": "zonal wind export (Sa_u = wind/sqrt(2) in the datm datamode), [m/s]"},
    "Sa_v": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m/s", "default": 0.0, "description": "meridional wind export (Sa_v = Sa_u in the datm datamode), [m/s]"},
    "Sa_shum": {"type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "default": 0.0, "description": "specific humidity export (Sa_shum), [kg/kg]"},
    "Sa_ptem": {"type": "parameter", "units": "K", "default": 273.15, "description": "potential temperature export (Sa_ptem), [K]"},
    "Sa_pbot": {"type": "parameter", "units": "Pa", "default": 101325.0, "description": "bottom-level pressure export (Sa_pbot), [Pa]"},
    "Sa_tbot": {"type": "parameter", "units": "K", "default": 273.15, "description": "bottom-level temperature export (Sa_tbot), [K]"},
    "Faxa_rainc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "mm/s", "default": 0.0, "description": "convective rain flux export, treated as mm/s on import: lnd_import_export.F90:535-539 delivers the coupler kg/m2/s rate and converts it with the unity factor (1 m3/1000 kg)*(1000 mm/m), so the import state is mm/s"},
    "Faxa_rainl": {"type": "parameter", "units": "mm/s", "default": 0.0, "description": "large-scale rain flux export, treated as mm/s on import (unity kg/m2/s -> mm/s conversion, lnd_import_export.F90:535-539)"},
    "Faxa_snowc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "mm/s", "default": 0.0, "description": "convective snow flux export, treated as mm/s on import (unity kg/m2/s -> mm/s conversion, lnd_import_export.F90:535-539)"},
    "Faxa_snowl": {"type": "parameter", "units": "mm/s", "default": 0.0, "description": "large-scale snow flux export, treated as mm/s on import (unity kg/m2/s -> mm/s conversion, lnd_import_export.F90:535-539)"},
    "Faxa_lwdn": {"type": "parameter", "units": "W/m^2", "default": 0.0, "description": "downward longwave flux export (Faxa_lwdn), [W/m2]"},
    "Faxa_swvdr": {"type": "parameter", "units": "W/m^2", "default": 0.0, "description": "visible direct shortwave flux export (Faxa_swvdr), [W/m2]"},
    "Faxa_swndr": {"type": "parameter", "units": "W/m^2", "default": 0.0, "description": "near-infrared direct shortwave flux export (Faxa_swndr), [W/m2]"},
    "Faxa_swvdf": {"type": "parameter", "units": "W/m^2", "default": 0.0, "description": "visible diffuse shortwave flux export (Faxa_swvdf), [W/m2]"},
    "Faxa_swndf": {"type": "parameter", "units": "W/m^2", "default": 0.0, "description": "near-infrared diffuse shortwave flux export (Faxa_swndf), [W/m2]"},
    "o2_molar_const": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 1.1047089691362286, "description": "o2 molar constant o2_molar_const = SHR_CONST_MWO2/SHR_CONST_MWDAIR = 31.999/28.966 (clm_varcon.F90), [-]"},
    "TKFRZ": {"type": "parameter", "units": "K", "default": 273.15, "description": "freezing point of water TKFRZ = SHR_CONST_TKFRZ (clm_varcon.F90:76), passed to the QSat law of forc_rh (lnd_import_export_utils.F90:88-90), [K]"},
    "percent": {"type": "parameter", "units": "%", "default": 100.0, "description": "percent conversion factor of forc_rh = 100*q/qsat (lnd_import_export_utils.F90:90), [%]"},
    "forc_hgt": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "description": "atmospheric reference height forc_hgt = Sa_z (lnd_import_export.F90:542), [m]"},
    "forc_topo": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "description": "atmospheric surface elevation forc_topo = Sa_topo (lnd_import_export.F90:544), [m]"},
    "forc_u": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m/s", "description": "zonal wind forc_u = Sa_u (lnd_import_export.F90:546), [m/s]"},
    "forc_v": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m/s", "description": "meridional wind forc_v = Sa_v (lnd_import_export.F90:548), [m/s]"},
    "forc_q": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "description": "specific humidity forc_q = Sa_shum (lnd_import_export.F90:550), [kg/kg]"},
    "forc_th": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "potential temperature forc_th = Sa_ptem (lnd_import_export.F90:552), [K]"},
    "forc_pbot": {"type": "unknown", "units": "Pa", "description": "bottom-level pressure forc_pbot = Sa_pbot (lnd_import_export.F90:554), [Pa]"},
    "forc_t": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "bottom-level temperature forc_t = Sa_tbot (lnd_import_export.F90:556), [K]"},
    "forc_hgt_u": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "description": "observational height of wind forc_hgt_u = forc_hgt (lnd_import_export_utils.F90:66), [m]"},
    "forc_hgt_t": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "description": "observational height of temperature forc_hgt_t = forc_hgt (lnd_import_export_utils.F90:67), [m]"},
    "forc_hgt_q": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "description": "observational height of humidity forc_hgt_q = forc_hgt (lnd_import_export_utils.F90:68), [m]"},
    "forc_vp": {"type": "unknown", "units": "Pa", "description": "vapor pressure forc_vp = forc_q*forc_pbot/(0.622 + 0.378*forc_q) (lnd_import_export_utils.F90:70; the vapor_pressure template), [Pa]"},
    "forc_rho": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/m^3", "description": "atmospheric density forc_rho = (forc_pbot - 0.378*forc_vp)/(rair*forc_t) (lnd_import_export_utils.F90:72-73; the density template), [kg/m3]"},
    "forc_po2": {"type": "unknown", "units": "Pa", "description": "partial pressure of o2 forc_po2 = o2_molar_const*forc_pbot (lnd_import_export_utils.F90:75), [Pa]"},
    "forc_wind": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m/s", "description": "wind speed forc_wind = sqrt(forc_u^2 + forc_v^2) (lnd_import_export_utils.F90:77), [m/s]"},
    "forc_solar": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "total incident solar forc_solar = forc_solad_vis + forc_solai_vis + forc_solad_nir + forc_solai_nir (lnd_import_export_utils.F90:79-83), [W/m2]"},
    "forc_rainc": {"type": "unknown", "units": "mm/s", "description": "convective rain forc_rainc = Faxa_rainc (lnd_import_export.F90:560), [mm/s]"},
    "forc_rainl": {"type": "unknown", "units": "mm/s", "description": "large-scale rain forc_rainl = Faxa_rainl (lnd_import_export.F90:562), [mm/s]"},
    "forc_snowc": {"type": "unknown", "units": "mm/s", "description": "convective snow forc_snowc = Faxa_snowc (lnd_import_export.F90:564), [mm/s]"},
    "forc_snowl": {"type": "unknown", "units": "mm/s", "description": "large-scale snow forc_snowl = Faxa_snowl (lnd_import_export.F90:566), [mm/s]"},
    "forc_rain": {"type": "unknown", "units": "mm/s", "description": "total rain forc_rain = forc_rainc + forc_rainl (lnd_import_export_utils.F90:85), [mm/s]"},
    "forc_snow": {"type": "unknown", "units": "mm/s", "description": "total snow forc_snow = forc_snowc + forc_snowl (lnd_import_export_utils.F90:86), [mm/s]"},
    "forc_rh": {"type": "unknown", "units": "%", "description": "relative humidity forc_rh = 100*forc_q/qsat(forc_t, forc_pbot) (lnd_import_export_utils.F90:88-90; the qsat_qs template), [%]"},
    "forc_lwrad": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "downward longwave forc_lwrad = Faxa_lwdn (lnd_import_export.F90:568), [W/m2]"},
    "forc_solad_vis": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "visible direct solar forc_solad_vis = Faxa_swvdr (lnd_import_export.F90:570), [W/m2]"},
    "forc_solad_nir": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "near-infrared direct solar forc_solad_nir = Faxa_swndr (lnd_import_export.F90:572), [W/m2]"},
    "forc_solai_vis": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "visible diffuse solar forc_solai_vis = Faxa_swvdf (lnd_import_export.F90:574; stays gridcell-level - the downscale loop copies only solad, F90:193), [W/m2]"},
    "forc_solai_nir": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "near-infrared diffuse solar forc_solai_nir = Faxa_swndf (lnd_import_export.F90:576), [W/m2]"}
   },
   "equations": [
    {"lhs": "forc_hgt", "rhs": "Sa_z"},
    {"lhs": "forc_topo", "rhs": "Sa_topo"},
    {"lhs": "forc_u", "rhs": "Sa_u"},
    {"lhs": "forc_v", "rhs": "Sa_v"},
    {"lhs": "forc_q", "rhs": "Sa_shum"},
    {"lhs": "forc_th", "rhs": "Sa_ptem"},
    {"lhs": "forc_pbot", "rhs": "Sa_pbot"},
    {"lhs": "forc_t", "rhs": "Sa_tbot"},
    {"lhs": "forc_hgt_u", "rhs": "forc_hgt"},
    {"lhs": "forc_hgt_t", "rhs": "forc_hgt"},
    {"lhs": "forc_hgt_q", "rhs": "forc_hgt"},
    {"lhs": "forc_vp", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "vapor_pressure", "bindings": {"q": "Sa_shum", "pbot": "Sa_pbot"}}},
    {"lhs": "forc_rho", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "density", "bindings": {"pbot": "Sa_pbot", "vp": "forc_vp", "tbot": "Sa_tbot"}}},
    {"lhs": "forc_po2", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": ["o2_molar_const", "Sa_pbot"]}},
    {"lhs": "forc_wind", "rhs": {"op": "sqrt", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "^", "args": ["forc_u", 2]}, {"op": "^", "args": ["forc_v", 2]}]}]}},
    {"lhs": "forc_solar", "rhs": {"op": "+", "args": ["forc_solad_vis", "forc_solai_vis", "forc_solad_nir", "forc_solai_nir"]}},
    {"lhs": "forc_rainc", "rhs": "Faxa_rainc"},
    {"lhs": "forc_rainl", "rhs": "Faxa_rainl"},
    {"lhs": "forc_snowc", "rhs": "Faxa_snowc"},
    {"lhs": "forc_snowl", "rhs": "Faxa_snowl"},
    {"lhs": "forc_rain", "rhs": {"op": "+", "args": ["forc_rainc", "forc_rainl"]}},
    {"lhs": "forc_snow", "rhs": {"op": "+", "args": ["forc_snowc", "forc_snowl"]}},
    {"lhs": "forc_rh", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": ["percent", {"op": "/", "args": ["forc_q", {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "qsat_qs", "bindings": {"T": "forc_t", "p": "forc_pbot", "TKFRZ": "TKFRZ"}}]}]}},
    {"lhs": "forc_lwrad", "rhs": "Faxa_lwdn"},
    {"lhs": "forc_solad_vis", "rhs": "Faxa_swvdr"},
    {"lhs": "forc_solad_nir", "rhs": "Faxa_swndr"},
    {"lhs": "forc_solai_vis", "rhs": "Faxa_swvdf"},
    {"lhs": "forc_solai_nir", "rhs": "Faxa_swndf"}
   ]
  },
  "Downscale": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {"ref": "./clm_templates.esm"}
   ],
   "variables": {
    "forc_t_grc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "K", "default": 273.15, "description": "gridcell atmospheric temperature (the not-downscaled gridcell field of atm2lndType), [K]"},
    "forc_th_grc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "K", "default": 273.15, "description": "gridcell atmospheric potential temperature, [K]"},
    "forc_q_grc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "default": 0.0, "description": "gridcell specific humidity, [kg/kg]"},
    "forc_pbot_grc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "Pa", "default": 101325.0, "description": "gridcell bottom-level pressure, [Pa]"},
    "forc_rho_grc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "kg/m^3", "default": 1.2, "description": "gridcell atmospheric density, [kg/m3]"},
    "forc_solar_grc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "W/m^2", "default": 0.0, "description": "gridcell total incident solar, [W/m2]"},
    "forc_solad_vis_grc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "W/m^2", "default": 0.0, "description": "gridcell visible direct solar, [W/m2]"},
    "forc_solad_nir_grc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "W/m^2", "default": 0.0, "description": "gridcell near-infrared direct solar, [W/m2]"},
    "forc_rain_grc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "mm/s", "default": 0.0, "description": "gridcell total rain (forc_rain_not_downscaled_grc), [mm/s]"},
    "forc_snow_grc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "mm/s", "default": 0.0, "description": "gridcell total snow (forc_snow_not_downscaled_grc), [mm/s]"},
    "forc_lwrad_grc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "W/m^2", "default": 0.0, "description": "gridcell downward longwave (forc_lwrad_not_downscaled_grc), [W/m2]"},
    "forc_topo_grc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m", "default": 0.0, "description": "gridcell surface elevation (forc_topo_grc; the elevation the atmospheric forcing is valid at), [m]"},
    "forc_hgt_grc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m", "default": 30.0, "description": "gridcell atmospheric reference height zbot (forc_hgt_grc), [m]"},
    "topo_col": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m", "default": 0.0, "description": "column surface elevation (topo_inst%topo_col), [m]"},
    "needs_downscaling": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 0.0, "description": "1 when the column is in the topo DownscaleFilterc (the glacier landunit columns; TopoMod.F90 DownscaleFilterc), [-]"},
    "landunit_glc": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 0.0, "description": "1 when the column's landunit is a glacier (istice) landunit, selecting the glc rain-snow ramp (atm2lndMod.F90:365-370), [-]"},
    "lapse_rate": {"type": "parameter", "units": "K/m", "default": 0.006, "description": "surface temperature lapse rate (lnd_in lapse_rate = 0.006), [K/m]"},
    "repartition_rain_snow": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 1.0, "description": "1 when precipitation is re-partitioned into rain/snow by temperature over all columns (lnd_in repartition_rain_snow = .true.; atm2lndMod.F90:359), [-]"},
    "glcmec_downscale_longwave": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 0.0, "description": "1 when longwave is downscaled for the filter columns (lnd_in glcmec_downscale_longwave = .false.; atm2lndMod.F90:511), [-]"},
    "precip_repartition_glc_all_snow_t": {"type": "parameter", "units": "K", "default": 271.15, "description": "temperature below which all precipitation is snow on glacier landunits (-2 C + tfrz; ctsm60_params.c260518.nc precip_repartition_glc_all_snow_t = -2.0), [K]"},
    "precip_repartition_glc_frac_rain_slope": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1/K", "default": 0.5, "description": "rain fraction ramp slope on glacier landunits, 1/(all_rain_t - all_snow_t) = 1/(0 - (-2)) (atm2lndType.F90:278), [1/K]"},
    "precip_repartition_nonglc_all_snow_t": {"type": "parameter", "units": "K", "default": 273.15, "description": "temperature below which all precipitation is snow on non-glacier landunits (0 C + tfrz; ctsm60_params.c260518.nc precip_repartition_nonglc_all_snow_t = 0.0), [K]"},
    "precip_repartition_nonglc_frac_rain_slope": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1/K", "default": 0.5, "description": "rain fraction ramp slope on non-glacier landunits, 1/(2 - 0) (atm2lndType.F90:278), [1/K]"},
    "lapse_rate_longwave": {"type": "parameter", "units": "W/m^2/m", "default": 0.032, "description": "longwave lapse rate (namelist_defaults_ctsm.xml lapse_rate_longwave = 0.032; Van Tricht et al. 2016), [W/m2/m]"},
    "longwave_downscaling_limit": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 0.5, "description": "relative limit on the longwave downscaling departure from the gridcell value (longwave_downscaling_limit = 0.5), [-]"},
    "rair": {"type": "parameter", "units": "J/(kg*K)", "default": 287.0423113650487, "description": "gas constant for dry air rair = SHR_CONST_RDAIR = SHR_CONST_RGAS/SHR_CONST_MWDAIR (clm_varcon.F90:55, shr_const_mod.F90:29), [J/kg/K]"},
    "grav": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m/s^2", "default": 9.80616, "description": "acceleration of gravity grav = SHR_CONST_G (clm_varcon.F90:51, shr_const_mod.F90:21), [m/s2]"},
    "cpair": {"type": "parameter", "units": "J/(kg*K)", "default": 1004.64, "description": "specific heat of dry air cpair = SHR_CONST_CPDAIR (clm_varcon.F90:59, shr_const_mod.F90:46), [J/kg/K]"},
    "TKFRZ": {"type": "parameter", "units": "K", "default": 273.15, "description": "freezing point of water tfrz = SHR_CONST_TKFRZ (clm_varcon.F90:76, shr_const_mod.F90:37), passed to the QSat laws of qs_g/qs_c, [K]"},
    "hfus": {"type": "parameter", "units": "J/kg", "default": 333700.0, "description": "latent heat of fusion for ice hfus = SHR_CONST_LATICE (clm_varcon.F90:63, shr_const_mod.F90:52), [J/kg]"},
    "denh2o": {"type": "parameter", "units": "kg/m^3", "default": 1000.0, "description": "density of liquid water denh2o = SHR_CONST_RHOFW (clm_varcon.F90:64, shr_const_mod.F90:43), [kg/m3]"},
    "mm_to_m": {"type": "parameter", "units": "m/mm", "default": 0.001, "description": "millimeters-to-meters conversion mm_to_m = 1.e-3 (atm2lndMod.F90 sens_heat_from_precip_conversion), [m/mm]"},
    "wv_to_dair_weight_ratio": {"type": "parameter", "units": "1", "default": 0.6219705862045155, "description": "ratio of the molecular weight of water vapor to that of dry air wv_to_dair_weight_ratio = SHR_CONST_MWWV/SHR_CONST_MWDAIR = 18.016/28.966 (clm_varcon.F90:71, shr_const_mod.F90:27-28), [-]"},
    "hsurf_diff": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "description": "column minus gridcell surface elevation hsurf_c - hsurf_g (atm2lndMod.F90:216-220, 236), the shared elevation difference of the topo downscaling and the longwave lapse, [m]"},
    "tbot_c": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "column surface temperature tbot_c = tbot_g - lapse_rate*(hsurf_c - hsurf_g) (atm2lndMod.F90:218), [K]"},
    "Hbot": {"type": "unknown", "units": "m", "description": "pressure scale height at the average temperature Hbot = rair*0.5*(tbot_g + tbot_c)/grav (atm2lndMod.F90:219), [m]"},
    "pbot_c": {"type": "unknown", "units": "Pa", "description": "column surface pressure pbot_c = pbot_g*exp(-(hsurf_c - hsurf_g)/Hbot) (atm2lndMod.F90:220), [Pa]"},
    "thbot_c": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "column potential temperature thbot_c = thbot_g + (tbot_c - tbot_g)*exp((zbot/Hbot)*(rair/cpair)) (atm2lndMod.F90:242), [K]"},
    "qs_g": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "description": "gridcell saturation specific humidity QSat(tbot_g, pbot_g) (atm2lndMod.F90:244), [kg/kg]"},
    "qs_c": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "description": "column saturation specific humidity QSat(tbot_c, pbot_c) (atm2lndMod.F90:245), [kg/kg]"},
    "qbot_c": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "description": "column specific humidity qbot_c = qbot_g*qs_c/qs_g (atm2lndMod.F90:247), [kg/kg]"},
    "rhos_c_estimate": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/m^3", "description": "density law at the column state rhos(qbot_c, pbot_c, tbot_c) (atm2lndMod.F90:257), [kg/m3]"},
    "rhos_g_estimate": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/m^3", "description": "density law at the gridcell state rhos(qbot_g, pbot_g, tbot_g) (atm2lndMod.F90:258), [kg/m3]"},
    "rhos_c": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/m^3", "description": "column density rhos_c = rhos_g*rhos_c_estimate/rhos_g_estimate (atm2lndMod.F90:259; identical to rhos_g when the column elevation equals the gridcell's), [kg/m3]"},
    "forc_t": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "column (downscaled) atmospheric temperature, [K]"},
    "forc_th": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "column (downscaled) potential temperature, [K]"},
    "forc_q": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "description": "column (downscaled) specific humidity, [kg/kg]"},
    "forc_pbot": {"type": "unknown", "units": "Pa", "description": "column (downscaled) bottom-level pressure, [Pa]"},
    "forc_rho": {"type": "unknown", "units": "kg/m^3", "description": "column (downscaled) atmospheric density, [kg/m3]"},
    "forc_solar": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "column total incident solar (copy of the gridcell value; atm2lndMod.F90:192), [W/m2]"},
    "forc_solad_vis": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "column visible direct solar (copy of the gridcell value; atm2lndMod.F90:193), [W/m2]"},
    "forc_solad_nir": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "column near-infrared direct solar (copy of the gridcell value; atm2lndMod.F90:193), [W/m2]"},
    "total_precip": {"type": "unknown", "units": "mm/s", "description": "total precipitation rain + snow before the repartition (atm2lndMod.F90:424), [mm/s]"},
    "all_snow_t": {"type": "unknown", "units": "K", "description": "all-snow temperature of the column's landunit ramp (atm2lndMod.F90:365-370), [K]"},
    "frac_rain_slope": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1/K", "description": "rain-fraction ramp slope of the column's landunit (atm2lndMod.F90:365-370), [1/K]"},
    "frac_rain": {"type": "unknown", "units": "1", "description": "fraction of precipitation that should become rain, clamped to [0, 1] (atm2lndMod.F90:419-422), [-]"},
    "forc_rain": {"type": "unknown", "units": "mm/s", "description": "column rain rate after the partition_precip repartition (atm2lndMod.F90:185, 425), [mm/s]"},
    "forc_snow": {"type": "unknown", "units": "mm/s", "description": "column snow rate after the partition_precip repartition (atm2lndMod.F90:186, 426), [mm/s]"},
    "rain_to_snow_conversion": {"type": "unknown", "units": "mm/s", "description": "rain converted to snow by the repartition, rain_orig - rain when the snow increased (atm2lndMod.F90:381-383), [mm/s]"},
    "snow_to_rain_conversion": {"type": "unknown", "units": "mm/s", "description": "snow converted to rain by the repartition, snow_orig - snow when the rain increased (atm2lndMod.F90:378-380), [mm/s]"},
    "eflx_sh_precip_conversion": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "sensible heat flux from the rain-snow conversion, (rain_to_snow - snow_to_rain)*mm_to_m*denh2o*hfus (atm2lndMod.F90:431-454), [W/m2]"},
    "lwrad_down": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "column longwave after the per-column lapse + clamp of the downscale_longwave branch (atm2lndMod.F90:532-541), [W/m2]"},
    "forc_lwrad": {"type": "unknown", "units": "W/m^2", "description": "column downward longwave (copy unless glcmec_downscale_longwave; atm2lndMod.F90:506), [W/m2]"}
   },
   "equations": [
    {"lhs": "hsurf_diff", "rhs": {"op": "-", "args": ["topo_col", "forc_topo_grc"]}},
    {"lhs": "tbot_c", "rhs": {"op": "-", "args": ["forc_t_grc", {"op": "*", "args": ["lapse_rate", "hsurf_diff"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "Hbot", "rhs": {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": ["rair", 0.5, {"op": "+", "args": ["forc_t_grc", "tbot_c"]}]}, "grav"]}},
    {"lhs": "pbot_c", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": ["forc_pbot_grc", {"op": "exp", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": ["hsurf_diff", "Hbot"]}]}]}]}},
    {"lhs": "thbot_c", "rhs": {"op": "+", "args": ["forc_th_grc", {"op": "*", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["tbot_c", "forc_t_grc"]}, {"op": "exp", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [{"op": "/", "args": ["forc_hgt_grc", "Hbot"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["rair", "cpair"]}]}]}]}]}},
    {"lhs": "qs_g", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "qsat_qs", "bindings": {"T": "forc_t_grc", "p": "forc_pbot_grc", "TKFRZ": "TKFRZ"}}},
    {"lhs": "qs_c", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "qsat_qs", "bindings": {"T": "tbot_c", "p": "pbot_c", "TKFRZ": "TKFRZ"}}},
    {"lhs": "qbot_c", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": ["forc_q_grc", {"op": "/", "args": ["qs_c", "qs_g"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "rhos_c_estimate", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "rhos", "bindings": {"q": "qbot_c", "pbot": "pbot_c", "tbot": "tbot_c", "wv": "wv_to_dair_weight_ratio", "rair": "rair"}}},
    {"lhs": "rhos_g_estimate", "rhs": {"op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "rhos", "bindings": {"q": "forc_q_grc", "pbot": "forc_pbot_grc", "tbot": "forc_t_grc", "wv": "wv_to_dair_weight_ratio", "rair": "rair"}}},
    {"lhs": "rhos_c", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": ["forc_rho_grc", {"op": "/", "args": ["rhos_c_estimate", "rhos_g_estimate"]}]}},
    {"lhs": "forc_t", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["needs_downscaling", 0.5]}, "tbot_c", "forc_t_grc"]}},
    {"lhs": "forc_th", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["needs_downscaling", 0.5]}, "thbot_c", "forc_th_grc"]}},
    {"lhs": "forc_q", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["needs_downscaling", 0.5]}, "qbot_c", "forc_q_grc"]}},
    {"lhs": "forc_pbot", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["needs_downscaling", 0.5]}, "pbot_c", "forc_pbot_grc"]}},
    {"lhs": "forc_rho", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["needs_downscaling", 0.5]}, "rhos_c", "forc_rho_grc"]}},
    {"lhs": "forc_solar", "rhs": "forc_solar_grc"},
    {"lhs": "forc_solad_vis", "rhs": "forc_solad_vis_grc"},
    {"lhs": "forc_solad_nir", "rhs": "forc_solad_nir_grc"},
    {"lhs": "total_precip", "rhs": {"op": "+", "args": ["forc_rain_grc", "forc_snow_grc"]}},
    {"lhs": "all_snow_t", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["landunit_glc", 0.5]}, "precip_repartition_glc_all_snow_t", "precip_repartition_nonglc_all_snow_t"]}},
    {"lhs": "frac_rain_slope", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["landunit_glc", 0.5]}, "precip_repartition_glc_frac_rain_slope", "precip_repartition_nonglc_frac_rain_slope"]}},
    {"lhs": "frac_rain", "rhs": {"op": "min", "args": [1.0, {"op": "max", "args": [0.0, {"op": "*", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["forc_t", "all_snow_t"]}, "frac_rain_slope"]}]}]}},
    {"lhs": "forc_rain", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["repartition_rain_snow", 0.5]}, {"op": "*", "args": ["total_precip", "frac_rain"]}, "forc_rain_grc"]}},
    {"lhs": "forc_snow", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["repartition_rain_snow", 0.5]}, {"op": "-", "args": ["total_precip", "forc_rain"]}, "forc_snow_grc"]}},
    {"lhs": "rain_to_snow_conversion", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "and", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["repartition_rain_snow", 0.5]}, {"op": ">", "args": ["forc_snow", "forc_snow_grc"]}]}, {"op": "-", "args": ["forc_rain_grc", "forc_rain"]}, 0.0]}},
    {"lhs": "snow_to_rain_conversion", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": "and", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["repartition_rain_snow", 0.5]}, {"op": ">", "args": ["forc_rain", "forc_rain_grc"]}]}, {"op": "-", "args": ["forc_snow_grc", "forc_snow"]}, 0.0]}},
    {"lhs": "eflx_sh_precip_conversion", "rhs": {"op": "*", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["rain_to_snow_conversion", "snow_to_rain_conversion"]}, "mm_to_m", "denh2o", "hfus"]}},
    {"lhs": "lwrad_down", "rhs": {"op": "min", "args": [
     {"op": "max", "args": [
      {"op": "-", "args": ["forc_lwrad_grc", {"op": "*", "args": ["lapse_rate_longwave", "hsurf_diff"]}]},
      {"op": "*", "args": ["forc_lwrad_grc", {"op": "-", "args": [1.0, "longwave_downscaling_limit"]}]}]},
     {"op": "*", "args": ["forc_lwrad_grc", {"op": "+", "args": [1.0, "longwave_downscaling_limit"]}]}]}},
    {"lhs": "forc_lwrad", "rhs": {"op": "ifelse", "args": [{"op": ">", "args": ["glcmec_downscale_longwave", 0.5]}, "lwrad_down", "forc_lwrad_grc"]}}
   ],
   "tests": [
     {
      "id": "step1_p1",
      "description": "Import-law trace row (step 1, column c=1; the five traced cells are value-identical, so cell 1 pins all of them): the datm exports of datm_gswp3_exports.csv row (step 0, cell n=1) in as the Sa_*/Faxa_* overrides, out the CLM forcing rows of clm_bareground.csv (step 1, c=1; forc_t/forc_q/forc_pbot/forc_rho/forc_u/forc_v columns), clm_canopyflux.csv (step 1, stage=ent, c=1; forc_rain/forc_snow columns) and clm_surfrad.csv (step 1, c=1; forc_solad_vis/forc_solad_nir/forc_solai_vis/forc_solai_nir columns), through import_fields + derive_quantities (lnd_import_export.F90:542-577, lnd_import_export_utils.F90:66-90) and the downscale_forcings copy + partition_precip path (atm2lndMod.F90:180-195, 359-390; the traced column is a non-glacier soil column with needs_downscaling = 0, so the topo-downscaling branch is inactive). The one-step offset is the CESM coupling sequence itself: the data atmosphere runs after the land within each coupling interval, so the land is forced by the previous interval's atmosphere (every forc_* dump value equals its one-step-earlier datm export bit-exact). The forc_t and forc_pbot assertions are gridcell-value pass-throughs on this traced column and the forc_rain assertion pins the rain channel that is identically 0 on every traced step (all precipitation falls as snow below the all-snow temperature): each is kept once per file as a labelled coupling-wiring check. The forc_wind and forc_solar assertions are derived (not a dump column): forc_wind = sqrt(forc_u^2 + forc_v^2) and forc_solar = forc_solad_vis + forc_solad_nir + forc_solai_vis + forc_solai_nir, computed and re-verified by stage1/analysis/extract_m9_test_rows.py.",
      "time_span": {
       "start": 0.0,
       "end": 0.0
      },
